{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/440720-benedictions","id":440720,"title":"Benedictions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-13T18:21:54-07:00","id":440720,"title":"Benedictions","content":"I decided to start a separate thread rather than further derail the Second Edition thread... I think a lot of issues with Benedictions would be resolved if the game treated them as a plot hook with narrative weight rather than handwaved magic niche that need no discussion.<br /> <br /> That being the case, lets talk about their history and how they're wielded.<br /> <br /> - Do Benedictions predate Malleus Maleficarum (born in the late 15th/early 16th Century)?<br /> <br /> - If yes, how did Malleus get a monopoly on them? If no, how did Malleus discover them?<br /> <br /> - What does it mean to &quot;know&quot; a Benediction? Does each have a specific ritual incantation? Because if it's just praying and then a miracle happens, what is it you need to &quot;learn&quot; to gain a new one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T19:41:25-07:00","id":440796,"title":"","content":"In Rome, during the worst of the persecutions, an angel calling itself Amoniel appeared to a group of human Christians who mistakenly took refuge in the Necropolis of the Julii. With the rites they learned from the pallid angel, the small sect was able to escape and spread the rites to the select few Christians who were targeted by the blood-thirsty dead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T20:02:58-07:00","id":440811,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/47608-benedictions\">I am having the weirdest sense of deja vu.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T20:44:44-07:00","id":440829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/440720-benedictions?p=440811#post440811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/47608-benedictions\">I am having the weirdest sense of deja vu.</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have literally no recollection of this whatsoever...<br /> <br /> Edit: That thread got pretty off track talking about the extradiagetic &quot;whys&quot; of Benedictions - I want a interdiagetic discussion here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-13-2015, 11:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T00:48:36-07:00","id":441065,"title":"","content":"Depending on the needs of the campaign, I can think of several possible origins for benedictions.<br /> <br /> Watered down theban sorcery taught by their ghoul leader is the obvious choice.<br /> <br /> Rituals for manipulating sekhem ala mummy. <br /> <br /> A co-opted piece of god-machine infrastructure. <br /> <br /> Hedge magic/witchcraft given a christian make over. Since christian witches are mentioned as a thing in witchhunters, this one would hardly be sky shaking.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T00:59:52-07:00","id":441070,"title":"","content":"I'm not asking about the metaphysical origins - I know that's vague mystery. Not to mention largely irrelevant.<br /> <br /> I'm asking about how Malleus Maleficarum possesses them. Are they ritual incantations written in tomes only they possess?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T02:35:35-07:00","id":441118,"title":"","content":"I imagine its a question of faith. I could recite as many Ave Maria's as I please, but they wont mean anything to me. They will just be words. Although to a devote Christian may find a sense of relief and comfort in those words, and it'll mean something entirely different to them. Additionally, a different prayer may mean very little or nothing to a Christian, even if its a Christian prayer, if that person has never heard about the prayer before.<br /> Likewise, each Benediction is another such prayer. When you sit down and recite a Benediction, it wont work untill you're 100% unwaveringly convinced that it will. And nobody is dumb enough to just accept it, when somebody comes up and goes; &quot;Hey mate! Recite this 10000 word prayer over a corpse, and it'll come back to life! For realsies!&quot;. That kind of mental conditioning and indoctrination takes time and effort.<br /> Running with this, I could easily see something like forcing the owner of a Benediction to recite some small prayer each morning, to make sure that the mental conditioning stays intact. When he has a lot of Beneictions, thats alot of praying each morning.<br /> This could tie in with something I think was wirtten in Mage. I think there were mentioned something about every single human essentially being a Mage to a certain extend, and having the power to reshape the world. The Awakened then, was merely the people most proficient at doing so. This could mean that the benedictions are merely a collective act of mage. If 1 person can shape the world very insignificantly with his thoughts, then ten million of them who all think alike, can do a hell of a lot of 'insignificant'.<br /> <br /> In my own game though, I've just flavored them as the literal power of the Christian God, channeled through his mortal Paladins. Such power isn't given without an immense show of faith, however. The reason they dont go around healing people and resurrecting folks in the streets, is because very few people have enough of Gods fervor to literally bring people back from the dead, and they're afraid that the few people who possess such power will be murdered by the Churchs enemies if they go public. They're in a shadow-war with several very powerful supernatural foes, after all.<br /> I imagine this &quot;We dont do it, because then we'll be fucking murdered&quot; thing works in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T02:48:00-07:00","id":441126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krobeles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/440720-benedictions?p=441118#post441118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I imagine its a question of faith.</div> </div> </div> </div>The book specifically emphasizes that that is not how it works thought. Being an apostate, losing your faith, etc doesn't strip away your Benedictions. That was intentional by the authors to emphasize the Catholic theological themes - where the spiritual authority of priests is based not on their own piety, but on the institutional mandate granted to St. Peter by Christ, hence the authority of the Church to forgive sin even when its members sin themselves, and the rituals of the Church carrying real divine power in and of themselves (transubstantiation for example), not just symbolic or faith-based.<br /> <br /> That distinction is pretty important to the thematic contrast between the Long Night (who are all about &quot;Faith&quot;) and Malleus (who are all about &quot;Works&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T03:21:23-07:00","id":441143,"title":"","content":"Eh. I supose you're right. That does assume that you're useing both in your game, though. I think its a bad idea to try to incorporate too many different conspiracies in a Hunter game. Each one has enough material to run an entire game on, so mudding it up with multiple is not always such a fancy idea as it might sound.<br /> <br /> Then just flavor them as the divine power of God and have the experience cost repressent some Crusade-like trial that the priest has to undertake, to show his devotion to God, before God will allow him to wield his power? Certainly, Gods divine power existed before the 15th century. &quot;Benediction&quot; is just the word the Malleus uses for what Christian priests has been doing since 5000 years ago when God created the world.<br /> I still think the &quot;They dont do it publicly, because murder&quot; works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T08:47:08-07:00","id":441356,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the fact that a malleus member can become a cannibal rapist serial killer and keep their benedictions really puts a cramp on the whole &quot;It's theurgy just like the inquisition says it is.&quot; <br /> <br /> And considering anyone can make a pact with a demon and learn a benediction, I'd say the inquisition is hardly the only ones with benedictions, even if one disregards the optional sorcery or forbidden lore from mirrors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T19:56:00-07:00","id":442107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/440720-benedictions?p=441356#post441356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Yeah, the fact that a malleus member can become a cannibal rapist serial killer and keep their benedictions really puts a cramp on the whole &quot;It's theurgy just like the inquisition says it is.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Well as I said, it actually doesn't contradict their theology, because the spiritual authority of priests is not attached to their individual morality or piety - it's institutional descending from the mandate given to St. Peter by Christ.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T04:30:22-07:00","id":442419,"title":"","content":"I struggle to give a good history or description of them without knowing where they come from. Every idea I have seems to incline it towards something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T23:30:01-07:00","id":450200,"title":"","content":"It's not about their faith. It's about the faith of something else. Maybe the organization. Maybe an individual within it. Priests of the Malleus Malifcarum are &quot;loaned&quot; and allowed to participate in that faith, granting access to rites. The fuel is an external source they'll (probably) never even meet, so they attribute why to their piety. The how is specific rites and sacraments adhered to that make them eligible for participation. Unfortunately, whatever the /actual/ source of faith is, it's either blind, aloof or naive enough to allow for cannibal serial rapists to keep pieces of its power.<br /> <br /> /speculation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}